    <footnotes>
        <footnote id="F1">The reporting person sold only the number of shares of MetLife, Inc.'s common stock necessary to pay the exercise price of the options exercised on November 10, 2026, and related tax obligations and fees.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F2">The price reported is the weighted average price of the aggregate number of shares sold in multiple open market transactions. The shares were sold at prices between $102.59 to $103.235, inclusive. The reporting person undertakes to provide to the staff of the SEC, MetLife, Inc., or a security holder of the Issuer, upon request, full information regarding the number of shares purchased at each separate price.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F3">Includes 3,073 stock options previously added to the reporting person's award through an adjustment to maintain the intrinsic value of the stock options in light of the distribution by MetLife, Inc. to its shareholders of Brighthouse Financial, Inc. common stock. The reporting person did not receive shares of Brighthouse Financial, Inc. common stock on account of the stock options.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F4">The options became exercisable in three equal installments on February 28, 2018, 2019, and 2020.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F5">The options became exercisable in three installments on March 2, 2019, 2020 and 2021.</footnote>
        <footnote id="F6">The options became exercisable in three installments on February 26, 2020, 2021 and 2022.</footnote>
